  "name": "signalgrid",
  "displayName": "SignalGrid Operating Plane",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "The SignalGrid engineering operating plane packaged as a Claude Code plugin: the first-party role and ritual skills, the specialist agents, and the slash-command skills that run this repository. Hooks stay in project settings and are deliberately excluded so they do not double-fire.",
